# Clash Classic — clash · text/yaml; charset=utf-8 · .yaml
# 15 protocols · 50 examples · regenerate: pnpm test:unit -u
# Clash Classic does not support VLESS, Hysteria, TUIC, WireGuard or AnyTLS.

